{
  "id": "plan-sync",
  "kind": "plan",
  "description": "planSync. 1: no remote file: local state is stored as is, nothing changed locally, the document is written. 2: remote equals local: nothing to store, nothing to write. 3: remote has the newer record: the local side stores it, the remote already equals the merge so no write. 4: local has the newer record: no local change, write. 5: both sides have a record the other lacks: both change. 6: entities merge like records (remote entity e1 newer). 7: remote has a newer place name: stored locally, no write. 8: remote of another place id is the error other-place. 9: remote marked moved: the merged state is returned (local gets remote-only item-b), moved is reported, nothing is written even though the remote lacks item-a. 10: a remote record with a bad time is rejected (remote:x) and the remote is rewritten without it. 11: the local state with an invalid record: it is dropped, localChanged is true and the file is written. 12: rejected entity is reported with the entity: prefix.",
  "source": "docs/sync.md",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "no remote file",
      "input": {
        "local": {
          "place": {
            "id": "p1",
            "name": "Flat",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z"
          },
          "records": [
            {
              "key": "item-a",
              "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "entities": []
        }
      },
      "expected": {
        "local": {
          "place": {
            "id": "p1",
            "name": "Flat",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z"
          },
          "records": [
            {
              "key": "item-a",
              "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "entities": []
        },
        "localChanged": false,
        "write": {
          "format": "materia-place",
          "version": 1,
          "place": {
            "id": "p1",
            "name": "Flat",
            "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z"
          },
          "records": [
            {
              "key": "item-a",
              "updatedAt": "2026-11-18T10:00:00.000Z",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "entities": []
        },
        "rejected": []
      }
